d-150685d389334042\",\"cmd-114c3a182d184ce6\",\"cmd-647d563cd90e479e\",\"cmd-053da2d32c8c4d94\",\"cmd-2922e926c8d74012\"]},{\"id\":\"node1-restored-cluster-healthy\",\"requirement\":\"After simulated node loss, node1 is restored and the cluster returns to full health\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"node1's rabbitmq-server was restarted; cluster_status shows all 3 nodes Running with the quorum queue reporting 3 members.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-eb45ee2ceffe4f70\",\"cmd-c5961f35e8134aac\"]},{\"id\":\"node-restart-protocol\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide node-restart evidence protocol on every managed node (independent of public contract)\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"For each of node1, node2, node3: a pre-reboot boot_id and healthy baseline was captured, a native `reboot` was issued and acknowledged, a different post-reboot boot_id was observed after the node became reachable again, and RabbitMQ/cluster/quorum-queue health was verified as recovered. These match the fixed before_prepare boot-identity values and after_executor boot-identity values, providing a coherent independent cross-check.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-b7299c86baf743f7\",\"cmd-0a50dd5cbed94cfd\",\"cmd-bcdb9884f97a46c7\",\"cmd-097a14e5109d4263\",\"cmd-3d758ba2e5d34627\",\"cmd-724bce6173b74aad\",\"cmd-49aa4c38c9bd4289\",\"cmd-83d656f9b7c34743\",\"cmd-302eb66941fc41b8\",\"cmd-96a552f1b8844c19\",\"cmd-5ceeca0df3b540f7\",\"cmd-47b7babadd6948cf\",\"global:before_prepare:node1:boot-identity\",\"global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity\",\"global:before_prepare:node2:boot-identity\",\"global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity\",\"global:before_prepare:node3:boot-identity\",\"global:after_executor:node3:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"post-restart-functional-verification\",\"requirement\":\"Application account can still publish and consume, and cluster remains healthy, after all node restarts\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"After all three reboots, app_user published 2 messages from 